<title>USA: I-Flow sees Q3 Sept operating income up.</title>
<headline>I-Flow sees Q3 Sept operating income up.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>I-Flow Corp said Monday it expected operating income for its third quarter ended September 30 to reach $0.06 per share before one-time charges, compared to $0.04 for the same period last year.  </p>
<p>The company said it also foresaw its revenues hitting about $4.0 million against $2.6 million last year.</p>
<p>The one-time charges that would affect operating income come from its acquisition of Block Medical Inc.</p>
